so these are papers from economics,

00:25:41.420 --> 00:25:44.610
political science, geography,

00:25:44.610 --> 00:25:48.820
criminology, anthropology,

00:25:48.820 --> 00:25:50.870
marketing science.

00:25:50.870 --> 00:25:54.340
So think of this as a very
cross-disciplinary look.

00:25:54.340 --> 00:25:57.890
This is months and months
