00:27:42.430 --> 00:27:45.113
So again, this is going to
cause us to not look at,

00:27:46.890 --> 00:27:48.770
at least in the meta-analysis sense,

00:27:48.770 --> 00:27:52.650
a lot of important qualitative work,

00:27:52.650 --> 00:27:56.720
thinking about the causes of conflict.

00:27:56.720 --> 00:27:59.753
So this is again,
